        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fabián Bielinsky, Nelson Pereira dos Santos, Ricardo Darín, Gastón Pauls, Leticia Brédice, Tomás Fonzi, Alejandro Awada\n- Places: Buenos Aires, Argentina, Brazil\n- Works: Nine Queens\n- Roles: film directors, actors\n\nFacts:\n- Nelson Pereira dos Santos was born on 22 October 1928 and is a Brazilian film director.\n- Fabián Bielinsky was born on 3 February 1959 in Buenos Aires and was an Argentine film director.\n- Nine Queens is a 2000 Argentine crime drama film written and directed by Fabián Bielinsky.\n- Nine Queens stars Ricardo Darín, Gastón Pauls, Leticia Brédice, Tomás Fonzi, and Alejandro Awada.\n- Fabián Bielinsky died on 28 June 2006.",
